# Copy to .env and edit. `make start` reads it, and computes AGENTDECK_MOUNTS from `ghq list -p`
# itself - that list changes every time a repository is cloned, which is why it is not in here.
#
# Node's parser does NO expansion: `~` and `$HOME` stay literal, and the server does not expand
# them either, so every path below must be absolute.

# What command each session runs, as this user. Copy agents.example.json somewhere OUTSIDE every
# allowlisted repository - the server refuses to start if it is inside one.
AGENTDECK_PROFILES=/Users/you/.agentdeck/agents.json

# The https origin the phone loads. Unset, the Origin check on /api and /ws is off.
AGENTDECK_ORIGIN=https://your-mac.your-tailnet.ts.net

# Only if you are not using `make start`: colon-separated absolute paths, exact match and never
# prefix, so naming a parent directory makes the parent startable and none of the repositories
# inside it. Read once at boot. The phone's tab label is each path's basename.
# AGENTDECK_MOUNTS=/absolute/path/to/a/repo:/absolute/path/to/another

# Optional, defaults in the README's environment table.
# AGENTDECK_PORT=7777
# AGENTDECK_TOKEN_FILE=/Users/you/.agentdeck/token
# AGENTDECK_AGENT_STATE_DIR=/Users/you/.agentdeck/agent-state
# TMUX_SOCKET=agentdeck
